WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.900 --> 00:00:03.000
IRIS: Welcome to the Archive, traveler.

2
00:00:05.700 --> 00:00:08.170
Everything that ever happened is kept here.

3
00:00:08.274 --> 00:00:12.171
Where the record runs thin, we send someone
back to see it firsthand.

4
00:00:18.500 --> 00:00:21.442
I'm IRIS.
Today, you're the one we're sending.

5
00:00:21.692 --> 00:00:24.123
You'll go in as someone who was already there.

6
00:00:24.185 --> 00:00:25.757
No one will think twice.

7
00:00:28.033 --> 00:00:32.213
I'll be in your ear the whole time.
You're the only one who can hear me.

8
00:00:35.075 --> 00:00:36.476
So, are you ready?
